  "solution": {
    "text": "We know that,<br/><br/>Gibbs free energy,  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></math> <br/><br/>and  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> <br/><br/>So  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></math> <br/><br/>On differentiating, we get<br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math>     ...(i)<br/><br/>For an infinitesimal stage of a reversible process,<br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></math> <br/><br/>and  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>                  <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>∵</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> <br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>     ...(ii)<br/><br/>From equation (i) and (ii), we get<br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math> <br/><br/> <math><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math> <br/><br/>At constant temperature,  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> <br/><br/>So  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></math> <br/><br/> <math><msub><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>"
